    "user_request_original": "Optimize a 22-layer alternating TiO2/SiO2 dielectric stack on fused silica substrate at 45° incidence. Initialize odd-indexed TiO2 layers at 34nm and even-indexed SiO2 layers at 92nm. Apply simulated annealing optimizer for epochs 1-5 with exponential cooling schedule, then switch to L-BFGS optimizer with 1e-5 line-search tolerance for epochs 6-20. Thickness bounds: [20, 180] nm for all layers. Evaluate target score using mean reflectance in 450-650nm band and mean transmittance in 700-1000nm band with equal weighting. Report best_target_score, valid_candidates, tightest_margin, thicknesses_nm for all candidates. Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 450-650 nm, 700-1000 nm. soft objectives: high reflectance in 450-650 nm; high transmittance in 700-1000 nm; minimized crosstalk between bands. behaviors to suppress or avoid: transmittance in 450-650 nm; reflectance in 700-1000 nm. manufacturing constraints: maximum 24 layers.",
